"好" = "OK";
"连接 USB 采集卡后，在采集设置中选择视频设备。没有 USB 视频输入时不会自动打开内置或无线摄像头；这些摄像头只能手动选择。\n\n无需采集卡：打开一个有内容的其他应用窗口，将画面来源改为 Mac 窗口，授权屏幕录制后选择该窗口。源窗口需要保持打开并持续更新。\n\n音频可单独选择或关闭。录制与截图通过系统保存面板选择位置；画质增强仅处理实时预览，默认录制也应用色彩与源分辨率锐化，可在设置中关闭。\n\n拒绝权限后，可在系统设置的隐私与安全性中重新允许，再刷新设备或窗口；系统可能要求重启应用。" = "Connect a USB capture card and choose its video device in Capture settings. Without a USB video input, MoniView does not open a built-in or wireless camera automatically; these cameras must be selected manually.\n\nWithout a capture card: open another application window with visible content, set Source to Mac window, grant Screen Recording access, and select that window. The source window must stay open and keep updating.\n\nSelect audio independently or turn it off. Recording and snapshots use the system save panel. Enhancement affects the live preview; recordings include color adjustments and source-resolution sharpening by default, which can be disabled in settings.\n\nAfter denying permission, allow access in System Settings under Privacy & Security, then refresh devices or windows. macOS may require restarting the app.";

